stale-active-session-cleanup\\n**Spec:** @session-stale-cleanup\\n\\n### Own AC Coverage\\n- [x] ac-1..ac-9 are covered by targeted tests in `tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\\n\\n### Trait AC Coverage\\n- [x] Multiple inherited trait ACs are covered and/or explicitly marked N/A\\n- [ ] Missing inherited trait AC coverage annotations for this spec: `@trait-dry-run ac-4`, `@trait-json-output ac-3`, `@trait-error-guidance ac-3/ac-4/ac-5`, `@trait-multi-ref-batch ac-1/ac-3/ac-5`\\n\\n### Regression Gate\\n- [ ] `npm test` currently fails on this branch (`tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts`: 2 timeouts)\\n\\n### Decision\\nBlocking review. Please address MUST-FIX items below, then request re-review.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-03-01T06:06:49Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"b5715201026e0d48a5525261177bae1434603294\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOQ7Tfmc7mwm1h\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"chapel\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"MEMBER\",\"body\":\"## Review Summary\\n\\n**Task:** @implement-stale-active-session-cleanup\\n**Spec:** @session-stale-cleanup\\n\\n### Own AC Coverage\\n- [x] ac-1..ac-9 covered in `tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\\n\\n### Trait AC Coverage\\n- [x] Previously-missing inherited AC annotations are now present (`@trait-dry-run ac-4`, `@trait-json-output ac-3`, `@trait-error-guidance ac-3/ac-5`, `@trait-multi-ref-batch ac-1/ac-3/ac-5`)\\n- [x] Remaining inherited trait ACs are covered by tests or explicitly annotated N/A with rationale\\n\\n### Regression Gate\\n- [ ] `npm test` is still failing on this branch head (`f1ce5c9c38e1b726ce913a75991baf0b44a08008`)\\n  - `tests/cli-serve.test.ts` (\\\"No projects registered\\\" assertion)\\n  - `tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts` (2 timeout failures)\\n\\n### Quality Gates\\n- [ ] All tests pass (no regressions)\\n- [x] Own AC coverage verified\\n- [x] Trait AC coverage verified\\n- [x] Code quality reviewed\\n- [x] Spec alignment reviewed\\n\\nBlocki